{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25890062",
      "title": "Writing Our First Test",
      "sourceHash": "9b158d8bf9efe5c5085f053465085e46d02c3081b2f987cdbe52ddbb981943c4",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 3.36,
          "en": "To dive a bit deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.36,
          "end": 5.83,
          "en": "let's create a new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.83,
          "end": 8.703,
          "en": "In the Components folder which I also created now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 13.81,
          "en": "And here all create a rather straightforward",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.81,
          "end": 17.41,
          "en": "dummy component, which I'll name, Greeting.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.41,
          "end": 19.05,
          "en": "So that's the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.05,
          "end": 23.77,
          "en": "And then there I'll create my component function, greeting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.77,
          "end": 26.19,
          "en": "which I'll export here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.19,
          "end": 30.55,
          "en": "and in there I'll just return a div with a h2 tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.55,
          "end": 32.91,
          "en": "where I say, \"Hello World!\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.91,
          "end": 36.157,
          "en": "And below that a paragraph where I say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.157,
          "end": 38.427,
          "en": "\"It's good to see you.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.61,
          "end": 41.55,
          "en": "So of course, just a dummy component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.55,
          "end": 44.01,
          "en": "with some static output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.01,
          "end": 47.543,
          "en": "No state, no props, nothing fancy for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.92,
          "end": 50.54,
          "en": "Now this greeting component of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.54,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "can be used in App.js now, and therefore here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 58.11,
          "en": "instead of that logo, I'll import greeting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.11,
          "end": 61.223,
          "en": "from ./components/Greeting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.36,
          "end": 64.83,
          "en": "and then here, instead of rendering that header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.83,
          "end": 68.03999999999999,
          "en": "and all that stuff, I'll get rid of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.03999999999999,
          "end": 71.883,
          "en": "and I'll instead render greeting, that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.2,
          "end": 75.68,
          "en": "This of course implies that our test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.68,
          "end": 78.23,
          "en": "in App.test.js will now fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.23,
          "end": 80.62,
          "en": "because we won't find any element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.62,
          "end": 83.43299999999999,
          "en": "with a text of learn React anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 86.2,
          "en": "But that's fine because that was just",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.2,
          "end": 87.88,
          "en": "the starting code anyways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.88,
          "end": 90.71000000000001,
          "en": "and it's not the code I want here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.71000000000001,
          "end": 92,
          "en": "Instead for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92,
          "end": 94.21000000000001,
          "en": "I'll comment out this test here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.21000000000001,
          "end": 97.463,
          "en": "because I don't need a tested App.test.js anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.37,
          "end": 102.78999999999999,
          "en": "Instead, I wanna now write my own first test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.78999999999999,
          "end": 105.28999999999999,
          "en": "for this custom component we added here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.28999999999999,
          "end": 106.62299999999999,
          "en": "the greeting component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.74000000000001,
          "end": 111.72,
          "en": "And we could write that test an App.test.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.72,
          "end": 114.38,
          "en": "and render the greeting component from there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 114.38,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "or render the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 119.9,
          "en": "but the convention is to write this test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.9,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "as close as possible to the thing you want to test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 126.55,
          "en": "So if I wanna test the greeting component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.55,
          "end": 130.71,
          "en": "and for example, test that it's rendering the correct text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.71,
          "end": 135.71,
          "en": "then we should create a separate Greeting.test.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.38,
          "end": 138.123,
          "en": "and write our test in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 143.8,
          "en": "Now, any here, we write a test by using this test function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.8,
          "end": 146.04,
          "en": "which is globally available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 146.04,
          "end": 147.64,
          "en": "You don't need to import it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.64,
          "end": 148.953,
          "en": "it's available like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.89,
          "end": 153.96,
          "en": "And then as we saw, we give this test a description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.96,
          "end": 157.19,
          "en": "Now the text here is up to you, but generally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 157.19,
          "end": 160.98,
          "en": "you wanna briefly describe what your tests does.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.98,
          "end": 164.13,
          "en": "And here I wanna test whether we have the hello world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.13,
          "end": 165.82999999999998,
          "en": "text on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.82999999999998,
          "end": 168.35,
          "en": "So of course that's quite similar to what we tested",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.35,
          "end": 172.253,
          "en": "in App.test.js before, but we will get more fancy later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.18,
          "end": 178.18,
          "en": "So here I'll just say, \"renders Hello World as a text.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.77,
          "end": 183.89,
          "en": "Then we need to add a second argument to this test function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.89,
          "end": 185.7,
          "en": "which is an anonymous function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.7,
          "end": 188.193,
          "en": "which will contain the actual testing code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.67,
          "end": 194.26,
          "en": "Now in here, we typically wanna do three things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.26,
          "end": 196.24,
          "en": "when we write a test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.24,
          "end": 200.32999999999998,
          "en": "We wanna write a test by using the three A's.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.32999999999998,
          "end": 202.98,
          "en": "The first A stands for arrange.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.98,
          "end": 204.64,
          "en": "We wanna set up our tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.64,
          "end": 207.24,
          "en": "For example, we wanna render the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.24,
          "end": 209.3,
          "en": "which we wanna test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.3,
          "end": 212.34300000000002,
          "en": "We can also do additional setup work if it's required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.21,
          "end": 214.91,
          "en": "Then we wanna act.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.91,
          "end": 219.23,
          "en": "So we wanna do the thing, which we wanna actually test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.23,
          "end": 222.61,
          "en": "For example, if we wanna simulate a button click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.61,
          "end": 225.49,
          "en": "we want to do that as a second step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.49,
          "end": 227.26,
          "en": "It's not something we do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.26,
          "end": 231.52,
          "en": "but it is something that you often will do in some tests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.52,
          "end": 234.313,
          "en": "and it is something which we also will do later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.47,
          "end": 236.74,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.74,
          "end": 238.98,
          "en": "we want to assert the results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.98,
          "end": 242.04,
          "en": "So we wanna have a look at the output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.04,
          "end": 244.6,
          "en": "that's visible in the browser, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.6,
          "end": 248.58,
          "en": "and then see if that matches our expectations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.58,
          "end": 250.903,
          "en": "So these are our three A's.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.85,
          "end": 255.39,
          "en": "Translated to this test, if we want to arrange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 255.39,
          "end": 257.743,
          "en": "we wanna render greeting component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 259.01,
          "end": 262.78,
          "en": "And a for that, just as an App.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262.78,
          "end": 267.213,
          "en": "just as an App.test.js, we wanna import the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 267.213,
          "end": 269.29,
          "en": "that we do want to test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.29,
          "end": 274.29,
          "en": "So I will import greeting from the sibling Greeting.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.69,
          "end": 278.05,
          "en": "And then we can call render,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 278.05,
          "end": 283.05,
          "en": "which you need to import from testing-libraries/react",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 283.2,
          "end": 285.58,
          "en": "and you then render your component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285.58,
          "end": 289.02,
          "en": "And to be precise here, you pass JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.02,
          "end": 292.623,
          "en": "So you create your component elements, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 294.47,
          "end": 296.21,
          "en": "That's the arranged part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 296.21,
          "end": 299.09000000000003,
          "en": "Now we could do more here if more is required,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 299.09000000000003,
          "end": 302,
          "en": "but here, that's all we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 302,
          "end": 303.69,
          "en": "Then we want to act.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 303.69,
          "end": 306.63,
          "en": "We want to perform the main action that's interesting to us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 306.63,
          "end": 309.363,
          "en": "And here that's basically nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 311.38,
          "end": 312.58,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 312.58,
          "end": 317.07,
          "en": "we wanna assert and for that, I wanna look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 317.07,
          "end": 320.97,
          "en": "into that virtual Dom, if you want to call it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 320.97,
          "end": 323.92,
          "en": "so that rendered component content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.92,
          "end": 327.03,
          "en": "And since I want to test whether hello world",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.03,
          "end": 328.45,
          "en": "is rendered as a text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 328.45,
          "end": 331.49,
          "en": "I want to select an element by that text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 331.49,
          "end": 333.33,
          "en": "And if we find such an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 333.33,
          "end": 335.29,
          "en": "we know that the test succeeded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 335.29,
          "end": 338.193,
          "en": "If we don't find it, we know that the test failed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 339.15,
          "end": 341.53,
          "en": "For this, we can import screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 341.53,
          "end": 343.42,
          "en": "which gives us access to this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 343.42,
          "end": 347.43,
          "en": "a virtual screen to this virtual Dom, which was rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 347.43,
          "end": 349.03,
          "en": "if you want to call it like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 350.118,
          "end": 353.08,
          "en": "and we can use that screen to then find elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 353.08,
          "end": 354.48,
          "en": "on that screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354.48,
          "end": 356.86,
          "en": "Now for this, you've got various functions available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 356.86,
          "end": 361.69,
          "en": "You've get functions, find functions and query functions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.69,
          "end": 365.67,
          "en": "The main difference is when these functions throw errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 365.67,
          "end": 369.85,
          "en": "and if they return a promise or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 369.85,
          "end": 372.86,
          "en": "Get functions, will for example, throw an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 372.86,
          "end": 374.84,
          "en": "if an element is not found,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 374.84,
          "end": 377.01,
          "en": "query functions won't do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 377.01,
          "end": 379.84,
          "en": "and find functions will return a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 379.84,
          "end": 383.18,
          "en": "So there it's enough if an element is eventually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 383.18,
          "end": 384.203,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 385.18,
          "end": 388.86,
          "en": "Here, I will get an element by text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 388.86,
          "end": 391.99,
          "en": "So we'll use screen get by text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 391.99,
          "end": 395.74,
          "en": "And then here we need to define the texts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 395.74,
          "end": 397.42,
          "en": "for which we're looking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 397.42,
          "end": 400.28,
          "en": "Now, here, we can use a regular expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 400.28,
          "end": 403.1,
          "en": "as it was the case in App.test.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 403.1,
          "end": 405.803,
          "en": "but you can also just, hard-code a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 407.1,
          "end": 409.53,
          "en": "It's just a little bit less flexible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 409.53,
          "end": 411.26,
          "en": "than a regular expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 411.26,
          "end": 413.18,
          "en": "But if you are looking for a full string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 413.18,
          "end": 415.993,
          "en": "as I'm doing it here, then it's absolutely fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 417.08,
